      "answer": {
        "type": "none"
      },
      "answerText": "No real solution: (x + 1)² = −2",
      "solution": [
        "x² + 2x = −3. Add 1: (x + 1)² = −2.",
        "A square is never negative. There is no real solution."
      ],
      "langType": "Ch 4 example 2",
